title: The District Conference Says No
subtitle: A district votes against the Zentrale.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('defy_vote'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('defy_vote');
var s = RG.speaker(Q.leading_faction);
Q.lw_name = s.name;
Q.lw_name_cap = s.name.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + s.name.slice(1);
Q.lw_n = RG.lw.rnd(62, 91);
Q.lw_ret_new = RG.lw.STARS.indexOf(s.id) >= 0 ? 1 : 0;
!}

= The District Conference Says No

The district conference of **[+ lw_d_name +]** met on Sunday in a dance hall in [+ lw_town +]. By [+ lw_n +] votes to a handful it passed a motion of no confidence in the Zentrale, and called on the whole party to return to the principles of the [+ lw_d_fname +]. The motion is in [+ lw_paper +] this morning.

- @speaker: Send [+ lw_name +] to the next conference.
- @accept: Concede half the motion.
- @dissolve: Dissolve the district organisation.

@speaker
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. [? if lw_ret_new = 1 : A famous name. The district may well be won back. ?][? if lw_ret_new = 0 : The hall may not listen. ?]
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
var p = 0.3 + RG.num(Q.unity) / 200 + (Q.lw_ret_new ? 0.2 : 0);
if (Math.random() < p) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {loyalty: 18});
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    Q.unity -= 2;
}
!}

[+ lw_name_cap +] speaks for two hours in the dance hall. [? if lw_out = 1 : The conference passes a second motion, which takes back most of the first. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The hall listens politely and votes the same way again. ?]

@accept
subtitle: The district is reconciled, and the [+ lw_d_fname +] gain ground in the party.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {loyalty: 12});
RG.lw.lean(Q.lw_d_faction, 2, 8);
Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 6;
!}

The Zentrale's answer concedes half the motion's points and promises a discussion of the rest. [+ lw_d_name +] calls it a victory, which it is.

@dissolve
subtitle: The district changes sides. One member in five will not sign.
on-arrival: {!
Q['district_' + Q.lw_d + '_faction'] = Q.leading_faction;
Q['district_' + Q.lw_d + '_loyalty'] = 55;
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {members: -0.2});
RG.lw.lean(Q.lw_d_faction, -1, -10);
Q.unity -= 4;
RG.ledger('The Zentrale dissolved the ' + Q.lw_d_name + ' district after it voted against the line.', 'lw_dissolve_' + Q.lw_d);
!}

Every member in [+ lw_d_name +] must sign a declaration of loyalty to keep the party card. Four in five sign. The others form a club, and then another club.
